---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import GeometricVisual from '../components/GeometricVisual.astro';
---

<Layout
  title='wo/men in tech · women in technical'
  description='面向技术与创造领域女性的慢节奏社群。在商业项目之外，做一些纯粹的事。'
  width='reading'
>
  <div class='page-root'>
    <div class='two-column-layout'>

      {/* ===== 左侧：品牌与宣言 (Brand anchor persists identically across all languages) ===== */}
      <aside class='sidebar' id='about'>

        {/* 永久保留的核心标识，不受中英文切换影响 */}
        <div class='brand-group'>
          <h1 class='site-title'>wo<span class='brand-slash'>/</span>men</h1>
          <p class='site-sub'>women in technical</p>
          <p class='site-zh'>"我们"</p>
        </div>

        {/* 中文版宣言 */}
        <div class='manifesto lang-zh'>
          <p>
            在每一个商业项目的空隙里，<br />
            总有一些东西是做给自己的。
          </p>
          <p>
            这里是那个地方。
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* 英文版宣言 */}
        <div class='manifesto lang-en'>
          <p>
            In between every commercial sprint,<br />
            there is always something we build for ourselves.
          </p>
          <p>
            This is that sanctuary.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class='sidebar-divider'></div>

        {/* 中文版面向群体 */}
        <div class='who-section lang-zh'>
          <span class='who-label'>面向群体</span>
          <p class='who-desc'>
            所有在技术与创造领域工作的女性——<br />
            产品、设计、工程、研究、写作……
          </p>
          <p class='who-note'>
            不需要特定头衔，<br />
            只是对作品本身有一点执念。
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* 英文版面向群体 */}
        <div class='who-section lang-en'>
          <span class='who-label'>CRAFTED FOR</span>
          <p class='who-desc'>
            All women creating across tech and design—<br />
            Product, Interaction, Engineering, Research, Writing...
          </p>
          <p class='who-note'>
            No specific titles required,<br />
            only a quiet devotion to the craft itself.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class='sidebar-footer'>
          <GeometricVisual type='subtle' height='72px' />
        </div>
      </aside>

      {/* ===== 右侧：核心展陈区 ===== */}
      <main class='content-main'>

        {/* 1. 我们做什么 */}
        <section class='content-block' id='events'>
          {/* 中文标题 */}
          <div class='section-heading-group lang-zh'>
            <div class='section-title-line'>
              <span class='section-serial'>01</span>
              <h2 class='section-main-title'>日常与创作机制</h2>
            </div>
            <p class='section-intro-text'>在商业流水线之外，守住纯粹的手艺与思考。</p>
          </div>

          {/* 英文标题 */}
          <div class='section-heading-group lang-en'>
            <div class='section-title-line'>
              <span class='section-serial'>01</span>
              <h2 class='section-main-title'>What We Do</h2>
            </div>
            <p class='section-intro-text'>Holding space for pure craft and deliberate contemplation outside commercial conveyor belts.</p>
          </div>

          {/* 中文展陈内容 */}
          <div class='editorial-panels-stack lang-zh'>
            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <span class='panel-index'>01</span>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>Coffee Chat</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge'>双周 · 线上 / 杭州</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                不是 networking。<br />
                两三个人，把手里的咖啡喝完，谈谈最近在做的事——或者什么也不谈。
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <span class='panel-index'>02</span>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>English Chat</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge'>双周 · 线上不定期</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                用英语聊产品、设计或技术。<br />
                一个不被评判的地方练习表达，没有标准答案，只有真实的体悟。
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <span class='panel-index'>03</span>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>作品 · Lab</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge'>小组制 · 慢工出细活</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                把那个一直在脑子里转的想法拿出来，找到懂你的人一起慢慢打磨。<br />
                不赶 deadline，不做为了证明什么的交付，只做值得的事。
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>

          {/* 英文展陈内容 */}
          <div class='editorial-panels-stack lang-en'>
            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <span class='panel-index'>01</span>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>Coffee Chat</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge'>Biweekly · Online / Hangzhou</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                Not networking.<br />
                Two or three people finishing a cup of coffee, sharing recent pursuits—or simply enjoying the silence.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <span class='panel-index'>02</span>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>English Tech & Design Chat</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge'>Biweekly · Virtual</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                Discussing product, design, or architecture in English.<br />
                A judgment-free space to practice expressing genuine craft reflections.
              </p>
            </article>

            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <span class='panel-index'>03</span>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>Craft Lab</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge'>Small Cohorts · Deliberate Work</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                Bring that lingering idea out of your private notes.<br />
                Polish it with peers who understand nuanced craft. No deadlines, no vanity MVPs, just work that matters.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class='section-footer-link'>
            <a href='/events' class='quiet-text-link'>
              <span class='lang-zh'>阅读完整手艺准则与共建机制</span>
              <span class='lang-en'>Explore Craft Manifesto & Circle Norms</span>
              <span class='link-arrow'>→</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* 2. 近期安排 */}
        <section class='content-block' id='schedule'>
          {/* 中文标题 */}
          <div class='section-heading-group lang-zh'>
            <div class='section-title-line'>
              <span class='section-serial'>02</span>
              <h2 class='section-main-title'>近期安排</h2>
            </div>
            <p class='section-intro-text'>小规模交流，确保每一次相聚都有充裕的聆听与表达。</p>
          </div>

          {/* 英文标题 */}
          <div class='section-heading-group lang-en'>
            <div class='section-title-line'>
              <span class='section-serial'>02</span>
              <h2 class='section-main-title'>Upcoming Gatherings</h2>
            </div>
            <p class='section-intro-text'>Intimate circles ensuring ample time for unhurried listening and honest exchange.</p>
          </div>

          {/* 中文排期内容 */}
          <div class='editorial-panels-stack lang-zh'>
            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <span class='panel-index'>01</span>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>AI 时代，还剩下什么是属于自己的？</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge status-open'>开放预约</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                探讨如何从工业流水线的焦虑中抽离，重新发现具有个人辨识度的表达。
              </p>
              <div class='panel-footer-meta'>
                <span>形式：杭州线下静谧小店 + 线上同步</span>
                <span>双周周末 · 3-5 人</span>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <span class='panel-index'>02</span>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>Show & Tell: Walk Me Through Something You Made</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge status-open'>开放预约</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                每人 5 分钟用英文讲述一个喜欢的界面细节、动效或代码架构，安全试错。
              </p>
              <div class='panel-footer-meta'>
                <span>形式：线上视频室 · 40 min</span>
                <span>双周周中晚间</span>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>

          {/* 英文排期内容 */}
          <div class='editorial-panels-stack lang-en'>
            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <span class='panel-index'>01</span>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>In the Age of AI, What Truly Remains Ours?</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge status-open'>Open for RSVP</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                Reflections on stepping away from automated pipeline anxiety to cultivate unmistakable personal expression.
              </p>
              <div class='panel-footer-meta'>
                <span>Format: Quiet café in Hangzhou + Online link</span>
                <span>Biweekly Weekend · 3–5 Participants</span>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class='editorial-panel'>
              <div class='panel-top'>
                <div class='panel-name-group'>
                  <span class='panel-index'>02</span>
                  <h3 class='panel-title'>Show & Tell: Walk Me Through Something You Made</h3>
                </div>
                <span class='panel-badge status-open'>Open for RSVP</span>
              </div>
              <p class='panel-desc'>
                5 minutes per person to share a favorite interface detail, micro-interaction, or code architecture in English in a judgment-free space.
              </p>
              <div class='panel-footer-meta'>
                <span>Format: Virtual Studio · 40 min</span>
                <span>Biweekly Weekday Evening</span>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>

          <div class='section-footer-link'>
            <a href='/upcoming' class='quiet-text-link'>
              <span class='lang-zh'>查看全部排期与答疑</span>
              <span class='lang-en'>View Full Schedule & Circle FAQ</span>
              <span class='link-arrow'>→</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* 3. 预约加入 (前置极细金线手作表单) */}
        <section class='content-block' id='join'>
          {/* 中文标题 */}
          <div class='section-heading-group lang-zh'>
            <div class='section-title-line'>
              <span class='section-serial'>03</span>
              <h2 class='section-main-title'>预约交流 · 加入“我们”</h2>
            </div>
            <p class='section-intro-text'>如果你有共鸣，欢迎随时留下你的声音。没有评判与考核。</p>
          </div>

          {/* 英文标题 */}
          <div class='section-heading-group lang-en'>
            <div class='section-title-line'>
              <span class='section-serial'>03</span>
              <h2 class='section-main-title'>Join the Circle</h2>
            </div>
            <p class='section-intro-text'>If our ethos resonates with you, you are warmly invited to leave a note. No judgment, no assessments.</p>
          </div>

          <div class='form-wrapper'>
            <form id='home-join-form' class='quiet-form'>

              {/* 字段 1: 称呼 */}
              <div class='form-field'>
                <label class='field-label' for='home-name'>
                  <span class='lang-zh'>如何称呼你</span>
                  <span class='lang-en'>What should we call you</span>
                  <span class='field-hint lang-zh'>名字或习惯的称呼</span>
                  <span class='field-hint lang-en'>Name or preferred moniker</span>
                </label>
                <input
                  type='text'
                  id='home-name'
                  name='name'
                  placeholder='名字或习惯的称呼'
                  data-placeholder-zh='名字或习惯的称呼'
                  data-placeholder-en='Your name or preferred moniker'
                  required
                  autocomplete='off'
                />
              </div>

              {/* 字段 2: 前置细金线单选 */}
              <div class='form-field'>
                <label class='field-label'>
                  <span class='lang-zh'>你在从事的领域</span>
                  <span class='lang-en'>Your Primary Craft</span>
                  <span class='field-hint lang-zh'>单选</span>
                  <span class='field-hint lang-en'>Single choice</span>
                </label>
                <div class='quiet-check-list' role='radiogroup' aria-label='从事领域'>
                  <label class='quiet-check-row is-radio'>
                    <input type='radio' name='craft' value='design' checked />
                    <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'></span>
                    <div class='check-content'>
                      <span class='check-title lang-zh'>设计 · 视觉传达 / 交互体验 (IxD)</span>
                      <span class='check-title lang-en'>Design · Interaction & Visual Craft (IxD)</span>
                      <span class='check-note lang-zh'>视觉、触感与动效</span>
                      <span class='check-note lang-en'>Visuals, typography & micro-interactions</span>
                    </div>
                  </label>

                  <label class='quiet-check-row is-radio'>
                    <input type='radio' name='craft' value='product' />
                    <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'></span>
                    <div class='check-content'>
                      <span class='check-title lang-zh'>产品 · 逻辑推敲 / 独立孵化 (PM)</span>
                      <span class='check-title lang-en'>Product · Product Thinking & Independent Work (PM)</span>
                      <span class='check-note lang-zh'>痛点挖掘与体验闭环</span>
                      <span class='check-note lang-en'>Problem framing & human experience loops</span>
                    </div>
                  </label>

                  <label class='quiet-check-row is-radio'>
                    <input type='radio' name='craft' value='engineering' />
                    <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'></span>
                    <div class='check-content'>
                      <span class='check-title lang-zh'>工程 · 前端架构 / 独立全栈 (FE)</span>
                      <span class='check-title lang-en'>Engineering · Frontend Architecture & Systems (FE)</span>
                      <span class='check-note lang-zh'>代码实现与鲁棒工程</span>
                      <span class='check-note lang-en'>Clean code, robust craftsmanship</span>
                    </div>
                  </label>

                  <label class='quiet-check-row is-radio'>
                    <input type='radio' name='craft' value='other' />
                    <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'></span>
                    <div class='check-content'>
                      <span class='check-title lang-zh'>研究 / 写作 / 自由创造者</span>
                      <span class='check-title lang-en'>Research / Writing / Independent Creators</span>
                      <span class='check-note lang-zh'>深度观察与跨界表达</span>
                      <span class='check-note lang-en'>Deep synthesis & cross-disciplinary inquiries</span>
                    </div>
                  </label>
                </div>
              </div>

              {/* 字段 3: 前置细金线多选 */}
              <div class='form-field'>
                <label class='field-label'>
                  <span class='lang-zh'>想参与的活动</span>
                  <span class='lang-en'>Gatherings of Interest</span>
                  <span class='field-hint lang-zh'>多选</span>
                  <span class='field-hint lang-en'>Multiple choice</span>
                </label>
                <div class='quiet-check-list'>
                  <label class='quiet-check-row'>
                    <input type='checkbox' name='interests' value='coffee_chat' checked />
                    <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'>
                      <svg viewBox='0 0 12 12' fill='none'><path d='M2.5 6L5 8.5L9.5 3.5'/></svg>
                    </span>
                    <div class='check-content'>
                      <span class='check-title lang-zh'>Coffee Chat</span>
                      <span class='check-title lang-en'>Coffee Chat</span>
                      <span class='check-note lang-zh'>双周轻聚 · 低压真诚</span>
                      <span class='check-note lang-en'>Biweekly · low pressure, genuine connection</span>
                    </div>
                  </label>

                  <label class='quiet-check-row'>
                    <input type='checkbox' name='interests' value='english_chat' checked />
                    <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'>
                      <svg viewBox='0 0 12 12' fill='none'><path d='M2.5 6L5 8.5L9.5 3.5'/></svg>
                    </span>
                    <div class='check-content'>
                      <span class='check-title lang-zh'>English Tech & Design Chat</span>
                      <span class='check-title lang-en'>English Tech & Design Chat</span>
                      <span class='check-note lang-zh'>双周线上 · 5 min Show & Tell</span>
                      <span class='check-note lang-en'>Biweekly online · 5 min Show & Tell</span>
                    </div>
                  </label>

                  <label class='quiet-check-row'>
                    <input type='checkbox' name='interests' value='portfolio_building' checked />
                    <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'>
                      <svg viewBox='0 0 12 12' fill='none'><path d='M2.5 6L5 8.5L9.5 3.5'/></svg>
                    </span>
                    <div class='check-content'>
                      <span class='check-title lang-zh'>作品 Lab · 慢工出细活</span>
                      <span class='check-title lang-en'>Craft Lab</span>
                      <span class='check-note lang-zh'>经验互借 · 代表作打磨</span>
                      <span class='check-note lang-en'>Small cohorts · patient iteration on signature work</span>
                    </div>
                  </label>
                </div>
              </div>

              {/* 字段 4: 正在做的事 */}
              <div class='form-field'>
                <label class='field-label' for='home-idea'>
                  <span class='lang-zh'>正在做的事，或者想交流的话题</span>
                  <span class='lang-en'>Current projects, questions, or topics you care about</span>
                  <span class='field-hint lang-zh'>可留空</span>
                  <span class='field-hint lang-en'>Optional</span>
                </label>
                <textarea
                  id='home-idea'
                  name='idea'
                  rows='2'
                  placeholder='一个未完成的作品，一个还没找到人聊的想法……'
                  data-placeholder-zh='一个未完成的作品，一个还没找到人聊的想法……'
                  data-placeholder-en='An unfinished side project, a nagging design question...'
                ></textarea>
              </div>

              {/* 字段 5: 联系方式 */}
              <div class='form-field'>
                <label class='field-label' for='home-contact'>
                  <span class='lang-zh'>联系方式</span>
                  <span class='lang-en'>Contact Information</span>
                  <span class='field-hint lang-zh'>微信号或邮箱 · 仅用于活动邀请</span>
                  <span class='field-hint lang-en'>WeChat ID or Email · strictly for circle invites</span>
                </label>
                <input
                  type='text'
                  id='home-contact'
                  name='contact'
                  placeholder='微信号或 Email'
                  data-placeholder-zh='微信号或 Email'
                  data-placeholder-en='WeChat ID or Email'
                  required
                  autocomplete='off'
                />
              </div>

              <div class='submit-zone'>
                <button type='submit' class='submit-btn-primary' id='home-submit-btn'>
                  <span class='lang-zh'>留下联系方式</span>
                  <span class='lang-en'>Submit Note & Reserve Seat</span>
                  <span class='btn-arrow'>→</span>
                </button>
                <span class='privacy-reassurance lang-zh'>
                  随时可退订联系 · 不作商业营销
                </span>
                <span class='privacy-reassurance lang-en'>
                  Unsubscribe anytime · Zero commercial marketing
                </span>
              </div>

              <div id='home-form-feedback' style='display: none;'>
                <div class='feedback-receipt-box'>
                  <div class='receipt-head'>
                    <span class='receipt-icon'>✦</span>
                    <div>
                      <h4 class='receipt-msg-title lang-zh'>收到了。</h4>
                      <h4 class='receipt-msg-title lang-en'>Received with warmth.</h4>
                      <p class='receipt-id-tag' id='home-receipt-id'>回执编号: WT-PENDING</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <p class='receipt-note lang-zh'>意向已保存在社群记录中，我们会在下次活动前联系你。</p>
                  <p class='receipt-note lang-en'>Your note has been securely saved. We will reach out quietly before our next circle gathering.</p>
                </div>
              </div>

            </form>
          </div>
        </section>

      </main>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<script>
  function setupHomeForm() {
    const form = document.getElementById('home-join-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
    const feedback = document.getElementById('home-form-feedback');
    const submitBtn = document.getElementById('home-submit-btn');
    const receiptDisplay = document.getElementById('home-receipt-id');

    // 动态同步输入框 Placeholder
    function syncPlaceholders() {
      const isEn = document.documentElement.getAttribute('data-lang') === 'en';
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement | HTMLTextAreaElement>('[data-placeholder-zh]').forEach(el => {
        el.placeholder = isEn ? (el.dataset.placeholderEn || '') : (el.dataset.placeholderZh || '');
      });
    }

    syncPlaceholders();
    window.addEventListener('site-language-change', syncPlaceholders);

    if (form && feedback) {
      form.onsubmit = async (e) => {
        e.preventDefault();
        const formData = new FormData(form);
        const payload = {
          name: formData.get('name'),
          craft: formData.get('craft'),
          interests: formData.getAll('interests'),
          idea: formData.get('idea'),
          contact: formData.get('contact'),
          clientTimestamp: new Date().toISOString(),
        };

        // 备份到本地存储
        try {
          const existing = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('wotech_rsvp_backup') || '[]');
          existing.push(payload);
          localStorage.setItem('wotech_rsvp_backup', JSON.stringify(existing));
        } catch (err) {}

        // 发送至 API
        let subId = `WT-${Date.now().toString(36).slice(-5).toUpperCase()}`;
        try {
          if (submitBtn) submitBtn.setAttribute('disabled', 'true');
          const res = await fetch('/api/join', {
            method: 'POST',
            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
            body: JSON.stringify(payload),
          });
          if (res.ok) {
            const resData = await res.json();
            if (resData.submissionId) subId = resData.submissionId;
          }
        } catch (err) {}

        const isEn = document.documentElement.getAttribute('data-lang') === 'en';
        if (receiptDisplay) {
          receiptDisplay.textContent = isEn ? `Receipt ID: #${subId}` : `回执编号: #${subId}`;
        }
        feedback.style.display = 'block';
        if (submitBtn) submitBtn.style.display = 'none';
        feedback.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'nearest' });
      };
    }
  }

  setupHomeForm();
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', setupHomeForm);
</script>

<style>
  .page-root {
    padding: var(--spacing-6) 0 var(--spacing-24);
  }

  .two-column-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2.2fr;
    gap: var(--spacing-16);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .sidebar {
    position: sticky;
    top: var(--spacing-8);
    padding-right: var(--spacing-8);
    border-right: var(--border-width-thin) solid var(--color-border-divider);
  }

  .brand-group {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-10);
  }

  .site-title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-4xl);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-light);
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-2);
    text-decoration: none !important;
    border-bottom: none !important;
  }

  .site-title .brand-slash {
    color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    opacity: 0.7;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .site-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    text-transform: lowercase;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .site-zh {
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: var(--spacing-1) 0 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .manifesto {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-8);
  }

  .manifesto p {
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    line-height: var(--line-height-loose);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-4);
  }

  .manifesto p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .sidebar-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-border-divider);
    margin: var(--spacing-6) 0;
    width: var(--spacing-8);
  }

  .who-section {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-10);
  }

  .who-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2);
  }

  .who-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-2);
  }

  .who-note {
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .sidebar-footer {
    padding-top: var(--spacing-6);
  }

  /* ===== 右侧：核心展陈区 ===== */
  .content-main {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-20);
  }

  .content-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .section-heading-group {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-8);
  }

  .section-title-line {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--spacing-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2);
  }

  .section-serial {
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .section-main-title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-2xl);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-normal);
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .section-intro-text {
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
  }

  /* ===== 极简展陈面板 ===== */
  .editorial-panels-stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-4);
  }

  .editorial-panel {
    background: var(--color-surface-pure);
    border: var(--border-width-thin) solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: var(--spacing-6) var(--spacing-6);
    position: relative;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-gold-dust);
    transition: background var(--transition-fast), border-color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .editorial-panel:hover {
    background: var(--color-surface-card);
    border-color: var(--color-border);
    border-left-color: var(--color-primary-dark);
  }

  .panel-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-3);
  }

  .panel-name-group {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--spacing-3);
  }

  .panel-index {
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .panel-title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .panel-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
  }

  .panel-badge.status-open {
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
  }

  .panel-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .panel-footer-meta {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-4);
    padding-top: var(--spacing-3);
    border-top: var(--border-width-thin) solid var(--color-border-divider);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
  }

  .section-footer-link {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-6);
  }

  .quiet-text-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-2);
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    text-decoration: none !important;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-gold-dust) !important;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast), border-color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .quiet-text-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
    border-bottom-color: var(--color-text-heading) !important;
  }

  .link-arrow {
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    transition: transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .quiet-text-link:hover .link-arrow {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  /* ===== 表单容器 ===== */
  .form-wrapper {
    background: var(--color-surface-pure);
    border: var(--border-width-thin) solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: var(--spacing-8);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-gold-dust);
  }

  .form-field {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-2);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-6);
  }

  .field-label {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .field-hint {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-normal);
  }

  .quiet-form input[type='text'],
  .quiet-form textarea {
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--color-surface-card);
    border: var(--border-width-thin) solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
    padding: var(--spacing-3) var(--spacing-4);
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    transition: border-color var(--transition-fast), background var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .quiet-form input[type='text']:focus,
  .quiet-form textarea:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    background: var(--color-surface-pure);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--color-gold-dust);
  }

  /* 前置细金线选项列表 */
  .quiet-check-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-2);
  }

  .quiet-check-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--spacing-3);
    padding: var(--spacing-3) var(--spacing-4);
    border: var(--border-width-thin) solid var(--color-border-divider);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
    background: var(--color-surface-card);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .quiet-check-row:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-surface-pure);
  }

  .quiet-check-row input {
    position: absolute;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .check-indicator {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    margin-top: 3px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--color-surface-pure);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .is-radio .check-indicator {
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .quiet-check-row input:checked ~ .check-indicator {
    border-color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    background: var(--color-primary-dark);
  }

  .is-radio input:checked ~ .check-indicator::after {
    content: '';
    width: 4px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-surface-pure);
  }

  .quiet-check-row svg {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    stroke: var(--color-surface-pure);
    stroke-width: 1.8;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .quiet-check-row input:checked ~ .check-indicator svg {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .check-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .check-title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .check-note {
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
  }

  .submit-zone {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-8);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-3);
  }

  .submit-btn-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-3);
    padding: var(--spacing-3) var(--spacing-6);
    background: var(--color-primary-dark);
    color: var(--color-surface-pure);
    border: none;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .submit-btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-text-heading);
  }

  .submit-btn-primary .btn-arrow {
    transition: transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .submit-btn-primary:hover .btn-arrow {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .privacy-reassurance {
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .feedback-receipt-box {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-6);
    padding: var(--spacing-6);
    background: var(--color-surface-card);
    border: var(--border-width-thin) solid var(--color-border);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-gold-dust);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
  }

  .receipt-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2);
  }

  .receipt-icon {
    color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
  }

  .receipt-msg-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
  }

  .receipt-id-tag {
    margin: 2px 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
  }

  .receipt-note {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
  }

  /* 响应式调整 */
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .two-column-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--spacing-12);
    }
    .sidebar {
      position: static;
      border-right: none;
      border-bottom: var(--border-width-thin) solid var(--color-border-divider);
      padding-right: 0;
      padding-bottom: var(--spacing-8);
    }
  }
</style>
